WEBVTT

00:00:18.589 --> 00:00:19.345
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Who’s next?

00:00:20.424 --> 00:00:23.480
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Can I have a cheese sandwich, please?

00:00:23.916 --> 00:00:24.705
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Anything else?

00:00:25.712 --> 00:00:27.485
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> And a Coke, please.

00:00:28.016 --> 00:00:28.750
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Ice and lemon?

00:00:29.013 --> 00:00:29.608
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> No, thanks.

00:00:43.495 --> 00:00:44.249
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> There you go.

00:00:44.551 --> 00:00:46.798
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Thanks. How much is it?

00:00:47.269 --> 00:00:48.588
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Six pounds seventy-five.

00:00:49.268 --> 00:00:49.819
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Here you are.

00:00:49.918 --> 00:00:50.523
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:53.960
Here’s your change.